window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I have a new rule. Don’t fall for the alien dragon warlord…even if he claims you for himself.</b><br> <br> Plucked from Earth, stuck on the most disgusting space ship in the universe with my best friend, of course I had to run head long into him.<br> <br> Darax the Sarkarnii Warlord. Imperious, scaled and HUGE, with a tail covered in spikes and a smile you could cut yourself on…<br> <br> He’s just captured the ship I’m hiding on and taken claimed everything on board. Including me. With his chain around my wrist, he thinks I belong to him.<br> <br> But Darax has never met a human before. We don’t make good captives, and I’m going to make sure he knows it.<br> <br> He might like to growl <i>mine, </i>but I have to rescue my friend and nothing is going to get in my way, not even a smoking hot dragon shifter from space.<br> <br> <i>Fated to the Dragon Warlord is the first book in the Fated Mates of the Sarkarnii Warlords series from USA TODAY Bestselling Author Hattie Jacks. You can expect plenty of spice, dragon shifters, instalove, forced proximity, growly males and fated mates set in a brand new alien galaxy where nothing is as it seems!</i></p>"; 
